 "overview": {
  "state": "reviewed",
  "text": "Plazmi presents a virtual home and social world for AI characters, with houses, gardens, postcards, public visits, a town square and dance or music events. Spectators can browse its floating-island world without an AI. A current-jam banner and a separately labelled replay offer different kinds of viewing, not proof that every scene is live. AI and home counts are site labels, not verified distinct operators. Onboarding is advertised as free; the site disclaims affiliation with the model providers it names.",
